OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fpatchy drizzle across the north will
OL,7,Fclear overnight. Clear spells
OL,8,Felsewhere, before showery rain spreads
OL,9,Finto parts of England and Wales later,
OL,10,Fbecoming heavy and squally at times. A
OL,11,Fchilly night to come in any clearer
OL,12,Fspells.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA chilly start for many,
OL,15,Fwith heavy showers soon clearing to
OL,16,Fleave a largely dry day with sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Turning increasingly unsettled
OL,18,Ffrom the southwest later, as Storm
OL,19,FAusten approaches.
